OL,3,ASacked Ukrainian defence minister calls
OL,4,Afor presidential election
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince the war broke out in 2022 Ukraine
OL,7,Fhas been under martial law, meaning
OL,8,Felections are suspended.
OL,10,FFedorov, who did not mention Zelensky
OL,11,Fby name in the video, was unexpectedly
OL,12,Ffired from his role as defence minister
OL,13,Flast month, just six months after his
OL,14,Fappointment.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
