OL,3,ASouth Korea shortens war games with US,
OL,4,Aciting Washington request
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Korea's annual joint military
OL,7,Fdrills with the US will be cut short by
OL,8,Fsix days at the request of Washington,
OL,9,Fits defence ministry has announced.
OL,11,FSeoul said that the "period and scale"
OL,12,Fof the 2026 Ulchi Freedom Shield
OL,13,Fexercise had been adjusted due to a
OL,14,F"proposal of the US side".
OL,16,FThe drill will now conclude on 21
OL,17,FAugust, rather than 27 August as
OL,18,Fplanned.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
