OL,3,ASouth Korea shortens war games with US,
OL,4,Aciting Washington request
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump, who  has
OL,7,Faccused Seoul of refusing to take part
OL,8,Fin action against Iran, told reporters
OL,9,Fon Wednesday that he expects to meet
OL,10,FNorth Korean leader Kim Jong Un later
OL,11,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
